Today I go to a government office.
The office is in the city.
This is a big office.
There are many people here.
The office is very busy.
I go inside.
I have a registration here.
There is a machine there.
I take a token from it.
It is a paper ticket.
My number is twenty-five.
There is a wooden bench there.
I sit on that bench.
I wait patiently.
It is the month of January now.
The weather is pleasant in Kochi.
I do not feel hot at all.
An official in the office calls out numbers.
I listen carefully.
I have all the documents in my hand.
